		{
			"id":"9e8fbe970b72f7dd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Resources** are read-only data an MCP server exposes behind a URI like `docs://documents`. Your application fetches them directly, giving deterministic access to files, database rows, API responses, or logs — no model deciding, no side effects.",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":355,
			"y":-560,
			"width":510,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"b1b7f5ed41bee4ba",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Appears when writing @ for example: \nWhat's in the @resume.pdf document",
